        "factory"   => @"<path d='M3 20V10l5 3V10l5 3V10l5 3v7z'/><path d='M6 20v-3M11 20v-3M16 20v-3'/><path d='M18 10V4h2v6'/>",
        "monitor"   => @"<rect x='3' y='4' width='18' height='12' rx='1'/><path d='M8 20h8M12 16v4'/>",
